cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ChemEmbed in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "ChemEmbed: A deep learning framework for metabolite identification using enhanced MS/MS data and multidimensional molecular embeddings"
abstract: >-
  ChemEmbed identifies metabolites from MS/MS spectra by predicting a
  multidimensional molecular embedding with a convolutional neural network and
  matching it against a reference database of pre-computed embeddings by cosine
  similarity.
type: software
authors:
